  "rightsScope": "Selected numerical facts and source links only. No article text, images, logos, or bulk transaction-register redistribution; no project-register reuse right asserted.",
  "verification": "The 2018–2020 official annual PDFs corroborate reported annual trading values, overall registration counts, sales counts and commercial-use shares. Dated WAM and Sharjah 24 reports corroborate 2018–2021 trading values of AED 22.5bn/24.2bn/15.9bn/26.2bn, overall registrations of 54,125/61,357/64,459/84,238, and sales of 3,254/3,328/3,773/6,304. The 2021 Sharjah 24 disclosure reports seven newly registered projects; archive entry 481 was mislabelled 2021 but contains the 2022 annual report and was excluded. The 2018–2020 commercial-use shares are percentages only; exact counts remain unknown. Previously reviewed 2022–2025 observations and receipts are retained.",
  "limits": "Annual emirate-wide reported totals, not transaction records, available spaces, sale prices, or a complete Sharjah project denominator. The 2018–2020 commercial-use shares are reported percentages, not exact commercial-sale counts; no counts are back-solved. The 2022 sale-use breakdown is exact category counts within 7,267 sales, not commercial inventory. Trading value includes transaction types beyond sales. Exact overall registration counts for 2023 and 2024 and sale counts for 2024 remain unavailable in these selected sources. Values are rounded at their stated precision. Annual periods must not be added to any same-year partial cumulative period.",
